# Never commit npm credentials. A project-scoped .npmrc is a convenient place
# to hold a publish token, and this repository is public — one `git add -A`
# would publish the token with it. The tracked lockfile is package-lock.json
# (npm); pnpm-lock.yaml is a local-install artifact only.
.npmrc
pnpm-lock.yaml
